{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（14日）下午1時25分，警方接報將軍澳影業路與集福路交界一處工地，有工人跌落兩米下位置。傷者清醒，惟未能返回地面。</p><p>救援人員到場救起傷者，隨後由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救；事故原因有待進一步調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者由救護車送院。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153701455463452672097638.jpeg/gyxRE2PFUZONppdxmRR_7rn4NshqFqq-1tjPytbYz8o\"/><figcaption>傷者由救護車送院。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><p>現場所見，是影業路與集福路一段馬路工地，放有挖泥車，並已挖出一個深坑。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153700441939251200079148.jpeg/4JMzMnzOhh73E6dRrFcIoSACdVWbaFp8e--pCVHvqQk\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153700444904755200564019.jpeg/7AIROWfuQ1sbQJQHO873IdZXzGkELM_myR7vdOMe73Q\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153700447777984512895740.jpeg/NezHAmz58AKf37ElF4cbm9rCF7Wd6NWD4vcqEMj3KhA\"/><figcaption>現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153700450806403072378104.jpeg/-acqtmSM97faeFMtPkVP3yfP21UGnoeHzxUWuuUVFro\"/><figcaption>現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260714/1153700453646077952701352.jpeg/ZTO6Bjw8-LUP3gLD8EBRQLtO128XN2dbQSP2p2sj9qc\"/><figcaption>現場是一處工地。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-14T06:19:25.761486+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}